      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>The argument is converted twice: CanvasBinding.SetGlobalCompositeOperation calls ToJsString once for IsSupportedCompositeOperation and again for the operator it stores, where Web IDL converts a DOMString argument once, so a toString that answers differently the second time decides what is stored.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
