      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>CssStyleEngine.ExpandShorthands (Broiler.CSS.Dom 0.1.0-preview.1) passes over tokens before the size it does not recognise and takes everything after the size as the family unchecked, so CanvasFont.TryResolve accepts these; Chromium ignores each one.</Message>
