      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>getRootNode is minted with a declared length of 1 in DomBridge/JsObjects.cs and DomBridge/JsObjects.NonElementNodes.cs, and on the character-data prototype at DomBridge/NodeInterfaces.cs. DOM §4.4 declares `Node getRootNode(optional GetRootNodeOptions options = {})`, so its only argument is optional and a browser reports 0 — a page feature-detecting composed-tree support by reading el.getRootNode.length gets the wrong answer.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
