      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>Relative sizes resolve against the 10px default in CanvasFont.TryResolve because ICanvasHost exposes no computed style for the canvas element; HTML and Chromium resolve them against a connected canvas's computed font-size (16px here).</Message>
