      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>Inline on* handlers fire after every addEventListener listener whenever they were registered: src/Broiler.HtmlBridge.Dom/Features/EventDispatchBinding.cs runs the listener list first and the inline handler afterwards, where HTML §8.1.7.1 registers a content attribute's listener when the attribute is set — at parse time.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
