      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>CssStyleEngine.ExpandShorthands (Broiler.CSS.Dom 0.1.0-preview.1) classifies the size with CssLengthParser.ParseToPixels and no viewport, so a vw/vh size, or a calc() holding a percentage, yields no font-size and CanvasFont.TryResolve rejects the assignment; Chromium accepts both. The setter stored '5vw serif' before and drew it at 10px sans-serif.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
